  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n 6 (8)/(15) ÷ (7)/(9) of (1(1)/(10) + 5(1)/(5)) + (2)/(5) ÷ 7 (1)/(5)\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ecca6f6efc35ad26919b14a9088b5d7151c453e76db137ff4d033fe3472e5b8f.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\nSimplifying the above equation using BODMAS Rule\n\n⇒ 6 (8)/(15) ÷ (7)/(9) of (1(1)/(10) + 5(1)/(5)) + (2)/(5) ÷ 7{1over5}\n\n⇒ 6 (8)/(15) ÷ (7)/(9) of ((11)/(10) + (26)/(5)) + (2)/(5) ÷ 7{1over5}\n\n⇒ 6 (8)/(15) ÷ (7)/(9) of ((63)/(10)) + (2)/(5) ÷ 7{1over5}\n\n⇒ (9 8)/(15) ÷ (49)/(10) + (2)/(5) ÷ 7{1over5}\n\n⇒ (9 8)/(15) × (10)/(49) + (2)/(5) × (5)/(36)\n\n⇒ (9 8)/(15) × (10)/(49) + (2)/(5) × (5)/(36)\n\n⇒ (4)/(3) + (1)/(18) \n\n⇒ (25)/(18)\n\n**∴ The value of 6 (8)/(15) ÷ (7)/(9) of (1(1)/(10) + 5(1)/(5)) + (2)/(5) ÷ 71over5 is (25)/(18).**",
